msgctxt "6024"
msgid "Minami"
msgstr "Minami"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "72_Saejima"
msgid "(Tonight's the showdown with ol' Majima.)"
msgstr "(Esta noche me reuniré de nuevo con Majima)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84_Kido"
msgid "Kamurocho's still swarming with cops, Saejima-san.\\r\nYou can't risk moving aboveground."
msgstr "Saejima-san, aún hay muchos policías en Kamurocho.\\r\nIr a la superficie es peligroso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "96_Kido"
msgid "If you're meeting Minami at the Millennium Tower tonight,\\r\nthen maybe you should rest here until nightfall."
msgstr "Si te reunirás con Minami en la Torre Millennium esta noche,\\r\ndeberías descansar hasta que llegue la hora."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108_Kido"
msgid "In the meantime, I'll go scope out the best route\\r\nto get you there in one piece."
msgstr "Mientras descansas, buscaré la mejor ruta para\\r\nllegar a la Torre Millennium para ti."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "120_Saejima"
msgid "Much obliged."
msgstr "Sí, por favor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "132_Kido"
msgid "Just lemme know when you want to rest up.\\r\nI'll stay put until then."
msgstr "Avísame cuando vayas a descansar.\\r\nEstaré aquí hasta entonces."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "144_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess I got some time till sundown.)"
msgstr "(Aún falta para que llegue la noche)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "168_Minami"
msgid "Whoa, down boy. Didn't come here lookin' for a fight."
msgstr "Oye, calmado. No vine buscando pelea."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "180_Minami"
msgid "It's just when I came in to say hi, gramps and his\\r\nlame-ass friends jumped me. So I, ya know..."
msgstr "Solo venía a buscarte, cuando estos tipos se\\r\nlanzaron sobre mí, así que pues... ya sabes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "192_Saejima"
msgid "Whaddya want?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "204_Minami"
msgid "The boss is askin' for ya. Word is you two were bros\\r\nback in the day."
msgstr "El jefe quiere verte. Dicen que ustedes eran\\r\ncompañeros hace tiempo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "216_Saejima"
msgid "Majima wants to meet?"
msgstr "¡¿Majima...?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "228_Minami"
msgid "Says to stop by the office tomorrow night."
msgstr "Así que ven mañana por la noche a la oficina."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "240_Saejima"
msgid "Where?"
msgstr "¿Dónde?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "252_Minami"
msgid "The Millennium Tower－ Y'know, that eyesore scrapin' the sky like it's nobody's business?"
msgstr "La Torre Millennium－Esa torre gigantesca en medio de la ciudad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "264_Saejima"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "Bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "276_Minami"
msgid "Knowin' the boss, he's prolly got some fucked up shit\\r\nwaitin' for ya on the top floor."
msgstr "Conociendo al jefe, te estará esperando en la cima."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "288_Minami"
msgid "I'd come prepared if I was you."
msgstr "Yo que tú voy preparado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "312_Saejima"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Oye."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "324_Minami"
msgid "'Sup?"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "336_Saejima"
msgid "Give a message to Majima."
msgstr "Dile a Majima..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "348_Saejima"
msgid "He best have some damn good answers ready.\\r\nIf not, he's gettin' his shit kicked in."
msgstr "Que será mejor que tenga respuestas,\\r\nde lo contrario, le cortaré las pelotas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "360_Minami"
msgid "Heh. Think you can go all medieval on the bossman?"
msgstr "Je, ¿crees que le das la talla al jefe?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "372_Minami"
msgid "No dig, but he'll straight up kill ya."
msgstr "Tal vez te llegue a matar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "384_Minami"
msgid "See ya."
msgstr "Hasta luego."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "408_Saejima"
msgid "(Best grab some shuteye before I settle the score tomorrow night.)"
msgstr "(Creo que descansaré por hoy. Mañana resolveré los problemas de hace 25 años)."

